# THE ARCHIVE (docs/ROADMAP.md slice 3, step 4), through the real keys. Across the
# water the goal is the archive, and Otto keeps it. Met, the goal asks him for one
# of the war's orders. He says every order checked out (forged_order) and that
# every one passed through one relay below (war_relay): the survey marks its shaft,
# far off on its bearing. Shown one, it reads like Elias (tradecraft). With June's
# leg staged behind him (--beats, --met; tours/june.tour plays it), the goal is then
# the relay below, the slice's last lead.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/archive.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --beats=marens_lead,reaper_down,built_halcyon,holdfast_hope,war_archive,covenant_speaker,june_named,june_knew,echo_kept --met=june --chose=rook.iron=paid --give=pick:1,kit_plate:1
#
# `at cast:otto` asks 49_cast where he stands; nothing is a coordinate. His replies
# in order: open "How the war started." first; at the orders "Where is it?", then
# "Show me one."
coast calm
wait 0.6

# --- across: the archive, and the man who keeps it ----------------------------------------
at cast:otto
await cast:otto 8
await goal:archive 5
await goal_shown 20
shot 01-the-goal-is-the-archive with cast:otto,goal:archive,goal_shown
press use
await talking 3
await met:otto 2
wait 0.4
shot 02-otto-keeps-the-record with talking,met:otto

# --- how the war started, and where the orders went -----------------------------------------
press use
await beat:forged_order 3
wait 0.4
shot 03-every-order-checked-out with talking,beat:forged_order
press use
await beat:war_relay 3
wait 0.4
shot 04-one-relay-below with talking,beat:war_relay
press use
wait 0.8
shot 05-the-goal-is-one-of-the-orders with goal:orders,goal_shown
press map 0.2
await app:map 6
wait 0.6
shot 06-the-survey-marks-the-shaft with app:map,goal:orders
press map 0.2
await app:none 5

# --- shown one ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
press use
wait 0.4
tap move_down
wait 0.3
press use
await beat:tradecraft 3
wait 0.4
shot 07-it-reads-like-him with talking,beat:tradecraft
press use
wait 0.8
shot 08-the-goal-is-the-relay-below with goal:relay,goal_shown
press map 0.2
await app:map 6
wait 0.6
shot 09-the-survey-marks-the-shaft-for-the-relay with app:map,goal:relay
press map 0.2
await app:none 5
